Package: likelyprofiler
Title: Likelihood Profiles for Nonlinear Objective Functions
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Baptiste",
           family = "Turpin",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "t.baptiste0@gmail.com",
		   comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8853-8718"))
Description: Profile likelihood confidence intervals for general objective 
	functions. Focus on potentially computationally intensive objective 
	functions, with control over the number of grid points and optimization 
	tools. Supports multiple optimization algorithms (optim, DEoptim, custom 
	optimizers), bootstrap likelihood ratio tests for data-driven confidence 
	thresholds, parallel computation, and flexible grid methods.
